<item><title>UNDP to run E508.5 million climate programme across three countries</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/undp-to-run-e508-5-million-climate-programme-across-three-f26582/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/undp-to-run-e508-5-million-climate-programme-across-three-f26582/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>The Adaptation Fund approved the regional funding for projects in Eswatini, Zambia and Zimbabwe, with work scheduled from 2027 to 2032.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:58:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
